W2F Import Complete

Source:
https://example.com

Nodes:
4,832

Native:
4,701

Raster fallback:
131

Missing fonts:
2

Warnings:
12

Visual confidence:
97.8%
```

支持展开：

```text
Missing Fonts
Fallback Nodes
Unsupported CSS
Grid Downgrades
Asset Failures
```

点击 diagnostic 可选中对应 Figma node，作为后期体验增强。

